## 4. BRAND & DESIGN SYSTEM (summary)

Follow `assets/QUIRRI_AI_CURSOR_DEVELOPMENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` sections 3–76, reconciled with `new_updated_design_four/quirri-ui.css`:

- **Colours:** Brand v1.0 — Teal `#0E5C6B`, Deep Teal `#06252B`, Signal Amber `#F5821F` (accent only), Amber 700 `#AC5B16` for white-label buttons, Mist `#F8F8F9` (wells), canvas Neutral 100 `#EEF0F0`, Ink `#102228`. No second accent, no brand-colour gradients.
- **Typography:** **Poppins** everywhere (300 / 400 / 500 / 700). Product uses 400/500; Bold only ≥28px. Scale sizes only (28·22·18·16·14·12·11·15 button). Never 600/800. Login cards stay the frozen centered layout.
- **Spacing:** 4px base unit (4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96)
- **Radius (portals, owner override Oct 2026):** 6px controls (buttons, inputs, selects, chips, nav) · 8px cards · 16px modals/drawers · full only for pills/avatars/progress
- **One amber CTA per view** — Amber 700 `#AC5B16` for buttons with white text (not Signal Amber)
- Solid Teal 500 surfaces (banner, side panel, filter bar, summary header) — **no** radial/linear gradients or glows; no generic purple AI SaaS look
- **Accessibility:** WCAG 2.2 AA — contrast, focus rings, keyboard nav, 44×44px touch targets, reduced motion
- **UX tone:** Calm, plain, encouraging — "a calm, well-prepared friend who wants you to do well"

Use central design tokens (`src/styles/quirri-design.css` and CSS variables). Do not scatter hard-coded brand values.

