## 4.1 FORMS & FIELD VALIDATION (MANDATORY)

Every editable input must use the Field Rules Catalog:

- Catalog: `src/lib/validation/fields.js` (`FIELD_RULES`)
- Schemas: `src/lib/validation/schemas/`
- UI: `QuirriRHFField` / `QuirriControlledField` with `fieldType`
- Rule file: `.cursor/rules/quirri-forms.mdc`

Do **not** invent maxLength, charset regex, or toast-only validation in page files. Extend the catalog once, reuse everywhere.

---

## 4.2 LOGIN UI PATTERN (MANDATORY — FROZEN)

**User lock:** Do **not** change login UI design until the user explicitly asks. See `.cursor/rules/quirri-login-freeze.mdc`.

All product login screens use the **centered Quirri card** pattern (not a split hero; not `Login.dc.html`):

- Mist canvas with a centered white card (`--radius-lg`, soft shadow) · Poppins
- Official logo from `/public/quirri-logo.svg` via `QuirriLogo` (centered)
- Headline: **Welcome back** · Subcopy: **Sign in to Quirri**
- Catalog-bound email + password · Primary CTA: Amber 700 **Sign in**
- Routes: `/auth/login` (SA) · `/admin/login` · `/faculty/login` · `/student/login`

Reference: SA `src/app/auth/login/page.js`; CA `src/app/admin/(auth)/login/page.jsx`; shared `PortalLoginPage` for faculty/student. Auth **logic** may change; **visual design** may not.

