## 6. PRIORITY ORDER

```text
1. Functional correctness
2. Existing project architecture
3. Accessibility
4. Quirri brand system
5. Responsive UX
6. Performance
7. Maintainability
8. Visual polish
```

Never sacrifice accessibility for appearance. Never invent product modules, roles, brand colours, or auth flows unless required by scope.

